  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Colors are completely inconsistent in the new UI. The Desktop HUD and chatbox should follow your UI theme properly. At the very least, it should match the default cyan UI theme that vrchat uses everywhere else across the game.\n\nThe first image attached is the current state of things on live build 1919 using both the default and \"Ember\" themes. While it can be argued that on the default theme, the new UI is visibly passable, there are a variety of issues if you are using a custom color theme for the UI. Lots of the problems are a clash in the visual design of the whole UI. \n\nThese themes are a VRC+ exclusive feature, and it saddens me to see that a feature that people are paying for does not function correctly. In particular, the keyboard in the search section has copy and paste buttons that do not apply the custom theme correctly.\n\nThe second image attached is a comparison of what the UI would look like if it properly inherited the UI from the selected theme, being the default cyan color scheme in this case. It looks a lot better than the clashing green as it currently is in build 1919.\n\nThis, of course, should work with other UI themes outside of the default cyan one.",
